    "section_columns_gEYhkW": {
      "type": "section-columns",
      "blocks": {
        "text_block_iNMTGn": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "enable_image": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Screenshot_2025-09-08_at_4.26.11_PM.png",
            "shape_class": "",
            "title": "CUSTOM WALLPAPER PRINTING",
            "text": "<p>Applied Coverings provides premium custom wallpaper printing for residential and commercial spaces. From artistic murals to refined decorative finishes, our prints enhance interiors with style and durability. We offer Type II wallcoverings, peel and stick options, and eco friendly materials ideal for offices, retail spaces, and private residences. Contact us to explore custom wallpaper solutions tailored to your space.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_color": "btn--neutral",
            "button_style": "btn--soft",
            "enable_video": false,
            "video_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_9VUPq3SxOc",
            "video_button_color": "text--white"
          }
        },
        "text_block_FhCxiU": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "enable_image": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Screenshot_2025-09-08_at_4.26.14_PM.png",
            "shape_class": "",
            "title": "PROFESSIONAL WALLPAPER INSTALLATION",
            "text": "<p>Our experienced installers deliver precise, seamless results for wallpaper and wall murals. Whether it is a feature wall in a home or a large scale mural in a corporate office, we handle surface preparation, panel alignment, and material application with care. Applied Coverings ensures every installation is clean, accurate, and built to last using commercial grade wallcovering materials.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_color": "btn--neutral",
            "button_style": "btn--soft",
            "enable_video": false,
            "video_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_9VUPq3SxOc",
            "video_button_color": "text--white"
          }
        },
        "text_block_rDEEtk": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "enable_image": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Screenshot_2025-09-08_at_4.26.18_PM.png",
            "shape_class": "",
            "title": "COMMERCIAL WALL COVERINGS",
            "text": "<p>We design and install durable commercial wallcovering solutions for offices, hospitality spaces, healthcare environments, and retail interiors. Whether the project is a high traffic corridor or a branded interior space, our Type II vinyl and custom wall murals combine visual impact with long term performance. Our commercial wallcoverings are engineered to meet daily use demands while elevating the overall interior atmosphere.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_color": "btn--neutral",
            "button_style": "btn--soft",
            "enable_video": false,
            "video_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_9VUPq3SxOc",
            "video_button_color": "text--white"
          }
        },
        "text_block_8389C7": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "enable_image": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Screenshot_2025-09-08_at_4.26.21_PM.png",
            "shape_class": "",
            "title": "WALLPAPER DESIGN CONSULTATION",
            "text": "<p>Our design team makes it easy to select the right wallpaper for your project. We guide you through pattern selection, material options, and scaling to achieve the ideal look for your space. From modern design styles to classic aesthetics, Applied Coverings helps bring your vision to life with wallpapers that feel intentional, cohesive, and professionally executed.</p>",
