    "section_faq_qY6NpW": {
      "type": "section-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "text_4bxz7Y": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What types of wallpaper materials do you offer?",
            "content": "<p>We offer a range of materials to fit both residential and commercial needs, including Peel & Stick Linen, Peel & Stick Canvas, Pre-Pasted Wallpaper, Suede Type II 20oz, and Terralon Smooth Type II. Peel & Stick options are great for DIY projects, Pre-Pasted is ideal for easy installation, and our Type II materials are designed for long-lasting durability in high-traffic commercial spaces.<br/><br/><a href=\"/materials\" title=\"Our Materials\">Click here for more information about our materials.</a></p>"
          }
        },
        "text_dhMf9q": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I order a custom wallpaper design or use my own artwork?",
            "content": "<p>Yes. You can choose from our curated pattern library or upload your own design, photo, or artwork. We’ll ensure your file is print-ready and scaled to fit your wall perfectly, giving you complete creative freedom.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_YzitRa": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do you ensure the wallpaper fits my wall perfectly?",
            "content": "<p>Simply measure the full width and height of each wall, including doors and windows. Our ordering system allows you to input exact dimensions, and we provide installation guides to ensure a seamless fit with minimal waste.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_J97hME": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Are the wallpapers durable and easy to maintain?",
            "content": "<p>Yes. Our commercial-grade materials are designed to withstand heavy use, while our residential wallpapers are washable and scuff-resistant. Most surfaces can be gently cleaned with a damp sponge or soft cloth, making maintenance simple.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_t9Y49p": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can the wallpaper be removed without damaging the wall?",
            "content": "<p>It depends on the material. Peel & Stick wallpapers can be removed cleanly without damage, making them perfect for renters or temporary spaces. Pre-Pasted and Type II wallpapers are more permanent solutions, designed for long-term installations.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "text_4bxz7Y",
